WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:01.420
Okay.

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:07.330
Please allow me just the briefest diversion
from horrible things happening the world over

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:13.160
and in the United States to mention something
very exciting and positive, which is that

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:21.289
the David Pakman show YouTube channel has
achieved and surpassed 900000 subscribers.

00:00:21.289 --> 00:00:24.009
In fact, I think we now are probably closer
to nine.

00:00:24.009 --> 00:00:28.210
No one yet, just shy of 900 and 1000 already.

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:31.039
This happened yesterday during a live stream.

00:00:31.039 --> 00:00:39.070
In fact, rolling over from eight hundred and
ninety nine thousand subscribers to nine hundred

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:41.320
thousand YouTube subscribers.

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:45.810
And so now the race to one million officially
begins.

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:51.670
Now, about 18 months ago, we were already
starting to look at, you know, could we get

00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:53.690
to a million by Election Day?

00:00:53.690 --> 00:00:55.830
It could happen 18 months out.

00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:58.240
It's sort of hard to know if things go well.

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:02.530
We could maybe hit a million subscribers before
the 2020 election.

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:05.430
We still could, although we're a little bit
behind right now.

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:10.060
According to Social Blade, based on recent
growth trends were expected to hit a million

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:11.909
subscribers on January 9th.

00:01:11.909 --> 00:01:14.490
So that would be before the inauguration.

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:19.619
But about two months after the election, however,
it's not impossible.

00:01:19.619 --> 00:01:21.180
So rough numbers.

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:27.240
We're 97 days from Election Day and we're
ninety nine thousand subscribers short of

00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:28.240
a million.

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:30.110
So call it you know, it's like one hundred
thousand.

00:01:30.110 --> 00:01:36.990
We need about a thousand thirty new subscribers
a day from here on out to hit a million by

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:38.249
Election Day.

00:01:38.249 --> 00:01:39.840
This actually isn't crazy.

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:43.139
The last few weeks we've been getting thirteen
hundred a day.

00:01:43.139 --> 00:01:45.469
We only need a thousand thirty a day.

00:01:45.469 --> 00:01:48.490
So we just have to hold that and then we can
do it now.

00:01:48.490 --> 00:01:50.090
This is really wild.

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:51.459
I was looking back at old numbers.

00:01:51.459 --> 00:01:57.130
You know what the David Pakman show launched
on YouTube a long time ago and we did it because

00:01:57.130 --> 00:02:00.719
Jank Yuga from the Young Turks who I met in
2008.

00:02:00.719 --> 00:02:04.599
At a radio conference, I told them what I
was doing.

00:02:04.599 --> 00:02:07.539
And he said, you know, you should throw some
cameras in your studio.

00:02:07.539 --> 00:02:08.720
Start putting the videos on YouTube.

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:09.720
It could be big.

00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:10.720
YouTube could be big.

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:12.230
That's what Genk said to me.

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:18.110
And so we started filming the show and it
took us five years to get our first hundred

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:22.780
thousand subscribers on YouTube to go from
zero to one hundred thousand.

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:24.700
It took five years.

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:29.750
The next hundred thousand took only a year
and five months.

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:34.240
We then got our next hundred thousand and
only eleven months.

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:38.920
We then went from 300000 to 400000 in eight
months.

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:41.040
Then things sort of slowed down a little.

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:44.240
It took us 10 months for the next hundred
thousand.

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:47.870
It took us eight months to get to 600000.

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:52.790
Took us another only four months to get to
700000 subscribers.

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:54.510
Seven to eight hundred thousand.

00:02:54.510 --> 00:03:02.470
Took seven months and it only took us five
months to go from 800000 to 900000 subscribers.

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:07.140
We have just over three months to get to a
million.

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:13.280
It would be the fastest gain of 100000 subscribers
since we've started.

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:14.970
But let's go for it.

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:15.970
Let's go for it.

00:03:15.970 --> 00:03:20.390
And by the way, I also want to start hearing
ideas from people about what to do to celebrate

00:03:20.390 --> 00:03:22.960
getting to one million.

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:23.960
Send me ideas.

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:28.930
A few people wrote in and said I should dye
my hair some color and it should be subject

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:31.040
to maybe people voting on what the color would
be.

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:32.710
I mean, I guess I would maybe do that.

00:03:32.710 --> 00:03:34.520
My hair color doesn't really lend itself.

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:36.810
I'd have to probably totally bleach it first
to dry it.

00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:38.370
I don't know that that's particularly good.

00:03:38.370 --> 00:03:42.680
You know, some of these chemical elements,
so to speak, aren't exactly the best.

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:43.780
My guesses.

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:50.170
I'm not ruling it out, but my guesses people
can probably come up with something more clever

00:03:50.170 --> 00:03:52.230
than just dyeing my hair to do it.

00:03:52.230 --> 00:03:55.450
One million YouTube subscribers.

00:03:55.450 --> 00:04:00.210
And meanwhile, fortunately, the show is growing
on other platforms as well.

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:04.660
So I'm not doing like a full state of the
show address here for you today.

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:10.319
But we have surpassed 40000 followers on our
Twitch channel, which is great.

00:04:10.319 --> 00:04:17.340
The audio podcast is has grown like 20 percent
per month for the last two, three months,

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:19.710
which has really given us a big, big boost.

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:23.430
And it's extraordinary to see more people
engaging with us on that platform.

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:26.000
So a lot of good things, needless to say.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:30.660
Send me your ideas for what to do to celebrate
one million subscribers, assuming we get there.

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:32.160
I don't know that it's a matter of if.

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:35.910
I think it's more a matter of when I want
it to be before Election Day.

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:37.800
Imagine if it was on Election Day.

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:43.540
Imagine if as we defeat Donald Trump, if we
do, we surpass one million subscribers.

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:45.670
I'd have to blow out memberships for two bucks
a year.

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:46.670
Right.

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:49.180
I'd have to do something completely unprecedented
if that happened.

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:50.260
But send me your ideas and we'll follow up
and discuss more.

